  'SessionId' => '2fc5a19060e1e129745b3349ca0d9cbe',
  'forumId' => '57',
  'title' => 'Grand Sirenis Mexico ',
  'postContent' => 'Hello Fellow brides. I need your help. 

I am currently looking into getting married in June 2016 and working through different resorts (suggestions always welcome). I am looking for good food good service and a reasonable wedding package. 

The and Sirenis has come across my table and one that is quite on the list because it\'s a good price and the package seems good. 


I am looking for any help from brides that are currently looking there or have gotten married there. What package did you use what extras did you get. My concern is I am looking at the presidential package because it comes with a DJ and private event and that\'s important to me but it says only for 10 people does that mean I have to pay a ton for extra guests? Has anyone dealt with this?? 

Wanted to go to moon palace where they offer free private events but the resort seems to be coming in high costs and grand Sirenis package seemed good! 


Any help is much appreciated. 

Thanks brides!!!

',
  'follow' => 'False',
  'sessionId' => '2fc5a19060e1e129745b3349ca0d9cbe',
)
