  'SessionId' => '76794d3e9e593f26f055a3e66f1ee0ae',
  'topicId' => '79279',
  'postContent' => '[quote name=\'yycbride2016\' timestamp=\'1434419856\' post=\'1898637\']@[member="Mickeyb"] I am getting married there February 2016! We are hoping to do the free wedding package (you need 10 double rooms booked for 7days) and then we are going to pay to upgrade to the private beach for the ceremony and private reception. 


You do have to pay more for guests after 10 but it should say on the package list if you got one from the coordinators. They are well priced. We will be bringing a few things of our own to save on renting costs (decorations and chair sashes). 


So far the resort is quick to respond and really helpful if I have any questions. I&#039;d recommend this resort this far. 



Sent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[/quote]
